(problem-one)
*title First problem
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 one start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=1 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file one.dat time xecfc
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=2 stop
*end

(problem-two)
*title Second problem
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 two start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=2 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file two.dat time xecfc
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=2 stop
*end
